ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja463:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja463:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:11.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:11.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja463:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja463:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:13.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:13.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja463:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja463:15.1": "<p class='endsection'>{}</p>", "ja463:16.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja463:17.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:17.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:17.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja463:17.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja463:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja463:0.2": "Ekādasakanipāta ", "ja463:0.3": "Mātuposakavagga ", "ja463:0.4": "9. Suppārakajātaka ", "ja463:1.1": "“Ummujjanti nimujjanti, ", "ja463:1.2": "manussā khuranāsikā; ", "ja463:1.3": "Suppārakaṁ taṁ pucchāma, ", "ja463:1.4": "samuddo katamo ayaṁ”. ", "ja463:2.1": "“Kurukacchā payātānaṁ, ", "ja463:2.2": "vāṇijānaṁ dhanesinaṁ; ", "ja463:2.3": "Nāvāya vippanaṭṭhāya, ", "ja463:2.4": "khuramālīti vuccati”. ", "ja463:3.1": "“Yathā aggīva suriyova, ", "ja463:3.2": "samuddo paṭidissati; ", "ja463:3.3": "Suppārakaṁ taṁ pucchāma, ", "ja463:3.4": "samuddo katamo ayaṁ”. ", "ja463:4.1": "“Kurukacchā payātānaṁ, ", "ja463:4.2": "vāṇijānaṁ dhanesinaṁ; ", "ja463:4.3": "Nāvāya vippanaṭṭhāya, ", "ja463:4.4": "aggimālīti vuccati”. ", "ja463:5.1": "“Yathā dadhīva khīraṁva, ", "ja463:5.2": "samuddo paṭidissati; ", "ja463:5.3": "Suppārakaṁ taṁ pucchāma, ", "ja463:5.4": "samuddo katamo ayaṁ”. ", "ja463:6.1": "“Kurukacchā payātānaṁ, ", "ja463:6.2": "vāṇijānaṁ dhanesinaṁ; ", "ja463:6.3": "Nāvāya vippanaṭṭhāya, ", "ja463:6.4": "dadhimālīti vuccati”. ", "ja463:7.1": "“Yathā kusova sassova, ", "ja463:7.2": "samuddo paṭidissati; ", "ja463:7.3": "Suppārakaṁ taṁ pucchāma, ", "ja463:7.4": "samuddo katamo ayaṁ”. ", "ja463:8.1": "“Kurukacchā payātānaṁ, ", "ja463:8.2": "vāṇijānaṁ dhanesinaṁ; ", "ja463:8.3": "Nāvāya vippanaṭṭhāya, ", "ja463:8.4": "kusamālīti vuccati”. ", "ja463:9.1": "“Yathā naḷova veḷūva, ", "ja463:9.2": "samuddo paṭidissati; ", "ja463:9.3": "Suppārakaṁ taṁ pucchāma, ", "ja463:9.4": "samuddo katamo ayaṁ”. ", "ja463:10.1": "“Kurukacchā payātānaṁ, ", "ja463:10.2": "vāṇijānaṁ dhanesinaṁ; ", "ja463:10.3": "Nāvāya vippanaṭṭhāya, ", "ja463:10.4": "naḷamālīti vuccati”. ", "ja463:11.1": "“Mahabbhayo bhiṁsanako, ", "ja463:11.2": "saddo suyyatimānuso; ", "ja463:11.3": "Yathā sobbho papātova, ", "ja463:11.4": "samuddo paṭidissati; ", "ja463:11.5": "Suppārakaṁ taṁ pucchāma, ", "ja463:11.6": "samuddo katamo ayaṁ”. ", "ja463:12.1": "“Kurukacchā payātānaṁ, ", "ja463:12.2": "vāṇijānaṁ dhanesinaṁ; ", "ja463:12.3": "Nāvāya vippanaṭṭhāya, ", "ja463:12.4": "baḷavāmukhīti vuccati. ", "ja463:13.1": "Yato sarāmi attānaṁ, ", "ja463:13.2": "Yato pattosmi viññutaṁ; ", "ja463:13.3": "Nābhijānāmi sañcicca, ", "ja463:13.4": "Ekapāṇampi hiṁsitaṁ; ", "ja463:13.5": "Etena saccavajjena, ", "ja463:13.6": "Sotthiṁ nāvā nivattatū”ti. ", "ja463:14.1": "Suppārakajātakaṁ navamaṁ. ", "ja463:15.1": "Ekādasakanipātaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ", "ja463:16.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja463:17.1": "Sirimātusuposakanāgavaro, ", "ja463:17.2": "Puna juṇhaka dhammamudayavaro; ", "ja463:17.3": "Atha pāni yudhañcayako ca dasa- ", "ja463:17.4": "Ratha saṁvara pāragatena navāti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja463:0.1": "", "ja463:0.2": "", "ja463:0.3": "", "ja463:0.4": "", "ja463:1.1": "", "ja463:1.2": "", "ja463:1.3": "", "ja463:1.4": "", "ja463:2.1": "Kurukacchā → bharukacchā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja463:2.2": "", "ja463:2.3": "", "ja463:2.4": "", "ja463:3.1": "aggīva suriyova → aggi suriyo ca (sya1ed, sya2ed); aggīva sūriyo (mr) ", "ja463:3.2": "", "ja463:3.3": "", "ja463:3.4": "", "ja463:4.1": "", "ja463:4.2": "", "ja463:4.3": "", "ja463:4.4": "", "ja463:5.1": "dadhīva khīraṁva → dadhiṁva khīraṁva (bj); dadhi ca khīrañca (sya1ed, sya2ed); dadhiṁ va khīraṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja463:5.2": "", "ja463:5.3": "", "ja463:5.4": "", "ja463:6.1": "", "ja463:6.2": "", "ja463:6.3": "", "ja463:6.4": "dadhimālīti → khīramālīti (mr) ", "ja463:7.1": "", "ja463:7.2": "", "ja463:7.3": "", "ja463:7.4": "", "ja463:8.1": "", "ja463:8.2": "", "ja463:8.3": "", "ja463:8.4": "", "ja463:9.1": "", "ja463:9.2": "", "ja463:9.3": "", "ja463:9.4": "", "ja463:10.1": "", "ja463:10.2": "", "ja463:10.3": "", "ja463:10.4": "", "ja463:11.1": "", "ja463:11.2": "saddo suyyatimānuso → samuddo suyyata'mānuso (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja463:11.3": "", "ja463:11.4": "", "ja463:11.5": "", "ja463:11.6": "", "ja463:12.1": "", "ja463:12.2": "", "ja463:12.3": "", "ja463:12.4": "baḷavāmukhīti → vaḷavāmukhīti (bj); balavāmukhīti (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr); vaḷabhāmukhīti (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja463:13.1": "", "ja463:13.2": "", "ja463:13.3": "", "ja463:13.4": "", "ja463:13.5": "", "ja463:13.6": "", "ja463:14.1": "", "ja463:15.1": "", "ja463:16.1": "", "ja463:17.1": "", "ja463:17.2": "", "ja463:17.3": "", "ja463:17.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja463:0.1": "", "ja463:0.2": "", "ja463:0.3": "",